# OpenSpec

New features, behavior changes, and product requirements use OpenSpec. Do not start by editing app code.

1. Scope is unclear → `/opsx-explore`
2. Change is known → `/opsx-propose <idea>` (planning artifacts only)
3. After the user reviews artifacts → `/opsx-apply`
4. After implementation is done → `/opsx-archive`, syncing delta specs into `openspec/specs/`

Skip this loop only for typos, dependency bumps, and refactors with no behavior change.

Shipped behavior lives in `openspec/specs/`. Change history lives in `openspec/changes/archive/`. `docs/prd-v0.1.md` and `docs/architecture.md` are background, not the source of truth.
